NSG-BASED DIRECTIONAL TRAFFIC TEST
============================================================


------------------------------------------------------------
Re-associated NSG1 with VM1 NIC
------------------------------------------------------------

Command:

az network nic update \
    -g az-net-lab-rg \
    -n az-net-lab-vm1VMNic \
    --network-security-group az-net-lab-nsg1

Result:
    NSG1 successfully associated with VM1 NIC.

Observed:

